Uninstall: 3 of 6 tools

  STATUS   TOOL           COMMANDS
  refused  Xcode          remove it by hand (see https://developer.apple.com/xcode/)
  remove   Google Chrome  brew uninstall --cask google-chrome
  remove   mkcert         mkcert -uninstall && brew uninstall mkcert
  remove   TypeScript     npm uninstall -g typescript
  refused  nvm            needed by Node.js LTS
  refused  GitHub CLI     not installed
